  --accent:        #D4B896;
  --dusty-rose:    #C4807A;
  --amber:         #D4A870;
  --mint:          #8FB996;
  --lavender:      #A99AB4;
  --text:          #3D342A;
  --text-sub:      #6B5D52;
  --text-muted:    #9B8E85;
  --border:        #DDD3C3;
  --shadow:        rgba(90,70,50,0.09);
  --shadow-md:     rgba(90,70,50,0.14);
  --r-sm:          10px;
  --r-md:          16px;
  --r-lg:          22px;
  --r-xl:          32px;
}
```

**Typography Fonts:**
- Serif: `Cormorant Garamond` (400, 500, 600 weights, italic)
- Sans-serif: `DM Sans` (300, 400, 500 weights)

**Components Included in Preview:**
1. Color Palette (10 colors: Sage, Light Sage, Deep Sage, Terracotta, Wheat, Lavender, Dusty Rose, Amber, Bark, Parchment)
2. Typography Scale (6 levels from 36px display to 11px captions)
3. Buttons (Primary, Secondary, Ghost, Warm variants with hover/active states)
4. Input Fields (with focus and error states)
5. Badges & Tags (Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced, XP, Streak)
6. Course Cards (with progress bars and thumbnails)
7. Navigation (Top bar and Bottom tab bar)
8. Question Cards (with multiple choice options and step indicators)
9. Progress Indicators (linear and step-based)
10. User Info Rows (with avatars and stats)
11. Achievement Badges (Common, Rare, Epic rarity tiers with locked state)
12. Answer Feedback Bars (Correct/Wrong states)

**Animations Defined:**
- `shimmer` - Skeleton loader animation (1.6s)

