- `viewer-boot-halo` (2.5s, scale/opacity pulse)
- `viewer-boot-spin` (7.5s, 360deg rotation)
- `viewer-boot-spin-reverse` (5.4s, reverse rotation)
- `viewer-boot-dot` (1.15s, vertical bounce)
- `home-course-card-slide-forward` / `backward` (280ms slide animations)
- `viewer-live2d-float` (6.8s floating motion)
- `viewer-live2d-breathe` (3.1s breathing/scale animation)
- `viewer-live2d-orbit` / `orbit-reverse` (11s/7.4s orbital rotation)

